#: 543abab444384bcab908920a98c92148 of utils.training.metrics:1
msgid "Metrics package: pluggable, auto-discovered evaluation metrics."
msgstr "Metrics package: pluggable, auto-discovered evaluation metrics."

#: 526d6c9efaf84fbea6a31306dd16eadb of utils.training.metrics:3
msgid ""
"Each metric lives in its own module under this package and registers via "
"``@register_metric(\"name\")``. Importing this package triggers static "
"discovery (component modules are scanned without being imported; a metric"
" module is imported lazily only when its value is first requested), "
"mirroring the efficiency-stages pattern. Add a metric by dropping a "
"decorated class into this directory — no manual registration elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Each metric lives in its own module under this package and registers via "
"``@register_metric(\"name\")``. Importing this package triggers static "
"discovery (component modules are scanned without being imported; a metric"
" module is imported lazily only when its value is first requested), "
"mirroring the efficiency-stages pattern. Add a metric by dropping a "
"decorated class into this directory — no manual registration elsewhere."

